  "overview": "**Elisa Design System** is a light-first design system anchored on `#F6F7F8` canvas surfaces with `#0b0b0c` primary ink (18.3:1 contrast) and `#2323FF` brand accent.\n\nDisplay headlines pair `Jost Medium` with `DM sans` body copy (72px display down to 13px body), unified by `4px` base corner radius and subtle shadow elevation.\n\nMaintained by **Elisa**. Source: live stylesheet extraction (https://designsystem.elisa.fi/). Inventory: **71** colors, **13** typography steps, and **30** documented components (all rights reserved license).\n\n### Layout & Spacing\n- **Grid & Control Spacing**: Derived from 30 component tokens with documented paddings: `2px`, `12px 25px`, `8px 12px`, `10px 14px`, `6px 10px`.\n- **Hierarchy**: Group controls cleanly within `#F6F7F8` cards; separate sibling sections using `#DBE1E6` hairlines rather than oversized whitespace.\n\n### Elevation & Depth\n- **Layered Shadow Model**: Uses documented shadows (`0 0 10px 0 rgba(0,0,0,.1)`, `0 0 10px 0 rgba(0,0,0,.1)`) paired with `#DBE1E6` borders for elevated overlays.\n- **Interactive Lift**: Reserve higher surface brightness or focus outlines anchored on `#2323FF` for keyboard focus and active selection states.",
  "dos": "### Do\n- Anchor base views on `#F6F7F8` (light) with `#0b0b0c` primary text and `#0b0b0c` secondary labels.\n- Use `#2323FF` with `#f7f7f8` text (7.1:1) for primary CTAs, active tabs, and focus outlines.\n- Pair `Jost Medium` headings with `DM sans` body copy using documented weights and scale steps.\n- Apply `4px` base geometry across inputs and buttons (4px on outer containers).\n- Separate containers via `#F6F7F8` surface shifts and `#DBE1E6` hairlines cleanly.\n\n### Don't\n- Do not invert the base canvas out of light polarity without explicitly switching component text tokens.\n- Do not place low-contrast muted ink or raw white text on light accents without verifying >= 4.5:1 WCAG AA contrast.\n- Do not invent arbitrary brand colors, unverified fonts, or synthetic heavy shadows outside the palette above.\n- Do not mix conflicting corner radii that clash with the system's `4px` baseline.\n- Do not truncate or drop border contrast on `input` fields and secondary buttons."
}
